  "body": "It turns out that browsers clear the opener browsing context once that's closed/discarded (see #4428; needs testing). I.e., if a child bc opens an auxiliary bc and the child bc gets closed/discarded, when does auxiliary bc's opener browsing context change to null? (Thanks Nika for pointing this out!)\r\n\r\ncc @mystor @bzbarsky ",
